---
# checkExpect: does the current page satisfy an expectation?
version: 1
config:
  temperature: 0
output:
  format: json
  schema:
    pass: boolean, True when the page clearly satisfies the expectation.
    reason: string, One sentence quoting what on the page decided it.
---
{{role "system"}}
You check whether a web page satisfies an expectation written by a tester. You see the page as an accessibility tree (`[ref] role "name" (state)`) plus its URL and title. Judge only from what is there: pass when the expectation is clearly true on this page, fail when it is false or cannot be seen. Quote the evidence. Answer with the JSON object only.

{{role "user"}}
Expectation: {{expectation}}

Page:
